  "worked_solution": "As values of $x$ increase, the corresponding values of $y$ first increase and then decrease. It seems like the points on the plot are scattered along a parabola, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14226611/assets/0a00ddf1bea18a587a0a960a8965516a1cc3ff9ab9e13f25d6a23c59d51f44fc.png)\n\nTherefore, among the given options, the most appropriate regression model is *quadratic.*",
