  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-17640\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>As values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> increase, the corresponding values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"10\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> first increase and then decrease. It seems like the points on the plot are scattered along a parabola, as shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-17640-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-17640-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, among the given options, the most appropriate regression model is <em>quadratic.</em></p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">exponential</div></div>",
